<title>USA: MBIA has half of Q2 new bond issue insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA has half of Q2 new bond issue insurance.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Inc said Tuesday it captured 50 percent of the new bond issue insurance market in the second quarter, up from 39 percent last year.</p>
<p>The holding company for MBIA Insurance Corp said it insured $14.4 billion of par value in the domestic new issue and secondary municipal bond markets in the quarter, compared with $11.3 billion last year.</p>
<p>The insurer reported a net income of $89.0 million, or $2.03 for the quarter, compared with a $79.7 million net, or $1.84 a share, the year before.</p>
